id: petrification-plating-fourth-effect
name: Petrification Plating
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/encounter
fromTrait: petrification-plating
fromEffect: 4
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Petrification Plating's fourth effect, as a Maneuver: every Plate off - Combat Rolls 1(T) each till the start of your next turn.
text: >
  (4)-[1/Encounter]: As a Standard Action with an Action Cost of 1 Action, you can remove all of your Plates. Increase your Combat Rolls by 1(T) for every Plate removed until the start of your next turn.

---

# The Plates gone; Plates Shed, its mark, a stack each (chat.mjs shedPlates).
[on used]
shedPlates();
